         Example of MULPIPES option.  MULPIPES produces a cross section          
         table for multiple round conduits.                                      
         The BOTT option permits the pipes to be a slightly different            
         elevations.  Be wary of computing a single table for use in the         
         CULVERT command if the pipes elevations differ by a large fraction      
         of the smaller diameter.  In this case, the flow type may differ for    
         each pipe and aggregating the pipes into one table may                  
         misrepresent the flow details.                                          
  
