         Example of a simple culvert.  FEQUTL can create tables of               
         type 13 and FEQ in Versions 6.2 and later can use them.                 
         Type 13 tables are more compact than type 6 and are more                
         easily read by a human.  They also take less space to                   
         store in FEQ.                                                           
  
 CULVERT                                                                         

